[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7921.91, "timestamp": "02:12:01", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7924.229, "timestamp": "02:12:04", "text": "你的第一场演出非常精彩，而且你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7926.87, "timestamp": "02:12:06", "text": "与威尔斯相处融洽。你作为狐狸的职业生涯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7929.27, "timestamp": "02:12:09", "text": "猎人已离开。来杯热饮暖暖身子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7931.83, "timestamp": "02:12:11", "text": "你起来。我本来打算请你吃一个的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7934.47, "timestamp": "02:12:14", "text": "但既然威尔斯被选中了，我们就把他放进去吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7935.91, "timestamp": "02:12:15", "text": "随他便。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7939.03, "timestamp": "02:12:19", "text": "耶。正确的。我确实把最后一个搞混了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7943.03, "timestamp": "02:12:23", "text": "小偷。这是我力所能及的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7945.35, "timestamp": "02:12:25", "text": "哦，我还可以让她了解一下我们的近况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7947.83, "timestamp": "02:12:27", "text": "工作领域。说实话，一直以来都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7949.589, "timestamp": "02:12:29", "text": "相当难。我刚才瞥了一眼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7951.99, "timestamp": "02:12:31", "text": "如今的工作，都是吃力不讨好的工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7956.709, "timestamp": "02:12:36", "text": "找到合适的工作。找到一些死亡之石。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7958.629, "timestamp": "02:12:38", "text": "告诉你也没用。甚至我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7961.03, "timestamp": "02:12:41", "text": "老手都不敢碰它，更别说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7963.83, "timestamp": "02:12:43", "text": "像你这样的新手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7965.91, "timestamp": "02:12:45", "text": "它正在寻找一种名为……的稀有矿物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7969.27, "timestamp": "02:12:49", "text": "古老的星状晶体。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7972.39, "timestamp": "02:12:52", "text": "客户是亨里克·埃尔德雷德。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7974.87, "timestamp": "02:12:54", "text": "是的，就是你认识的那个亨里克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7978.069, "timestamp": "02:12:58", "text": "格拉文坑现在成了污秽之徒的巢穴。一个"}]